#, ai
msgid "<0>Play</0> walks the chapter stage by stage with AI-generated narration."
msgstr "<0>Play</0> wuxuu cutubka ku dhex marinayaa heer-mar-heer isagoo wata sheeko uu soo saaray AI."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "<0>Play</0> walks the chapter stage by stage. The captions keep time over a quiet wind."
msgstr "<0>Play</0> wuxuu cutubka ku dhex marinayaa heer-mar-heer. Qoraallada hoose waxay la soconayaan dabayl aamusan."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "<0>Ask</0> uses the chapter’s context to research in Turath and answer with source citations."
msgstr "<0>Ask</0> wuxuu isticmaalayaa macnaha cutubka si uu cilmi-baaris ugu sameeyo Turath ugana jawaabo isagoo soo xiganaya ilaha."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "This excerpt does not give an exact departure date."
msgstr "Qaybtani ma sheegayso taariikh bixitaan oo sax ah."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The excerpt describes preparations, not a nightly delivery to the cave."
msgstr "Qaybtu waxay sharraxaysaa u diyaar-garowga, ee ma sharraxayso gaarsiin habeenkii ah oo godka loo geeyay."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The excerpt does not describe erasing footprints."
msgstr "Qaybtu ma sharraxayso tirtiridda raadadka cagaha."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The account does not describe the cave’s dimensions or layout."
msgstr "Sheekadu ma sharraxayso cabbirka godka ama qaabkiisa."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "This excerpt is not the full verse and does not itself name Abu Bakr or Mount Thawr."
msgstr "Qaybtani ma aha aayadda oo dhammaystiran, iyaduna qudheedu ma magacaabayso Abu Bakr ama Buurta Thawr."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "This is Ibn Kathir’s commentary, not the Quranic wording itself."
msgstr "Kani waa tafsiirkii Ibn Kathir, ee ma aha erayadii Quraanka qudhiisa."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "It does not give an exact location for the stay among Bani ‘Amr ibn ‘Awf."
msgstr "Ma sheegayso meel sax ah oo ku saabsan joogitaankii dhexdiisa Bani ‘Amr ibn ‘Awf."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The passage does not name the place; identifying it as Quba rests on other reports."
msgstr "Qoraalku ma magacaabayo meesha; u aqoonsashada inay tahay Quba waxay ku tiirsan tahay warbixinno kale."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The night of departure"
msgstr "Habeenkii bixitaanka"

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The leaders of Quraysh met in Dar al-Nadwah, the house where they settled their affairs, to decide what to do about the Prophet ﷺ now that they feared him."
msgstr "Hogaamiyayaashii Quraysh waxay ku kulmeen Dar al-Nadwah, gurigii ay ku xallin jireen arrimahooda, si ay u go'aansadaan waxa laga yeelayo Nabiga ﷺ hadda oo ay ka baqeen."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "That night they gathered at his door, waiting for him to sleep. He told ‘Ali to lie in his bed, wrapped in his green cloak, and assured him that no harm from them would reach him."
msgstr "Habeenkaas waxay ku soo urureen albaabkiisa, iyagoo sugaya inuu seexdo. Wuxuu ku yiri ‘Ali inuu ku seexdo sariirtiisa, isagoo ku duuban go'iisii cagaarnaa, wuxuuna u xaqiijiyay inaan wax dhib ah oo xaggooda ka imaanaya uusan soo gaari doonin."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "‘Ali stayed behind for another reason too. People in Makkah left their valuables with the Prophet ﷺ for safekeeping, because they knew his honesty. ‘Ali was to return every one of them."
msgstr "‘Ali wuxuu u dib dhacay sabab kale darteedna. Dadka jooga Makkah waxay agabkooda qaaliga ah u reebi jireen Nabiga ﷺ si uu u ilaaliyo, sababtoo ah waxay ogaayeen runtiisa iyo ammaanadiisa. ‘Ali wuxuu ahaa inuu mid kasta oo iyaga ka mid ah u celiyo."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The tent of Umm Ma‘bad"
msgstr "Teendhadii Umm Ma‘bad"

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "Further on they stopped at the tent of Umm Ma‘bad of Khuza‘ah and asked for hospitality. She had no food to offer, she said, and no ewe but one that gave no milk."
msgstr "In yar ka dib waxay ku joogsadeen teendhadii Umm Ma‘bad oo reer Khuza‘ah ah waxayna weydiisteen martisoor. Waxay tiri ma haysto wax cunto ah oo aan bixiyo, iyo wax lax ah mid aan caano lahayn mooyee."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The Prophet ﷺ called for the ewe, passed his hand over its udder and called on Allah. He milked it into a large vessel until it frothed, and said: drink, Umm Ma‘bad. Ibn Kathir notes that her story is well known and comes through routes that strengthen one another."
msgstr "Nabigu ﷺ wuxuu u yeeray laxtii, wuxuuna mariyay gacantiisa candhadeeda isagoo baryay Allah. Wuxuu ka soo moolay weel weyn ilaa ay xumbo ka dhalatay, wuxuuna yiri: cab, Umm Ma‘bad. Ibn Kathir wuxuu xusay in sheekadeedu ay tahay mid caan ah oo ku timaada waddooyin is xoojinaya."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "Ibn Ishaq reports that Quraysh met in Dar al-Nadwah to consult about the Prophet ﷺ once they feared him."
msgstr "Ibn Ishaq wuxuu weriyay in Quraysh ay ku kulmeen Dar al-Nadwah si ay ula tashadaan arrinta Nabiga ﷺ markii ay ka baqeen."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The excerpt covers the meeting, not what was said in it."
msgstr "Qaybtu waxay daboolaysaa kulanka, ee ma aha waxa dhexdiisa laga yiri."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "They gathered at his door at night; he told ‘Ali to sleep in his bed under his green cloak and assured him of safety."
msgstr "Waxay ku soo urureen albaabkiisa habeenkii; wuxuu ku yiri ‘Ali inuu ku seexdo sariirtiisa isagoo ku hoos jira go'iisii cagaarnaa wuxuuna u xaqiijiyay nabadgelyo."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "Ibn Kathir notes that al-Waqidi also relates this, combining several narrators’ accounts."
msgstr "Ibn Kathir wuxuu xusay in al-Waqidi uu isna tan weriyay, isagoo isku daraya sheekooyinka dhowr weriye."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "Ibn Ishaq introduces this with “as it has reached me”."
msgstr "Ibn Ishaq wuxuu tan ku bilaabay \"sida ay igu soo gaartay\"."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "They stopped at Umm Ma‘bad’s tent; she had only a ewe without milk, which then gave milk in abundance."
msgstr "Waxay ku joogsadeen teendhadii Umm Ma‘bad; waxay haysatay oo keliya lax aan caano lahayn, taas oo markaas bixisay caano aad u badan."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "Ibn Kathir calls the story well known, through routes that support one another. It does not fix where the tent stood."
msgstr "Ibn Kathir wuxuu ugu yeeray sheekada mid caan ah, iyadoo loo marayo waddooyin is taageeraya. Ma go'aaminayso halka ay teendhadu ku taallay."

#: src/content/details.js
#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "Al-Rahiq al-Makhtum"
msgstr "Al-Rahiq al-Makhtum"

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "The noon visit"
msgstr "Booqashadii Duhurnimo"

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "At the height of noon, an hour at which he never used to come, the Prophet ﷺ arrived at Abu Bakr’s house with his face covered. He said he had been given permission to leave. Abu Bakr asked to go with him, and he said yes."
msgstr "Markay ahayd barqo-kulul, xilli uusan marnaba u imaan jirin, ayuu Nabigu ﷺ yimid guriga Abuu Bakar isagoo wejigu u duuban yahay. Wuxuu u sheegay in loo oggolaaday inuu baxo. Abuu Bakar ayaa weydiistay inuu raaco, isna wuxuu yiri haah."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "This is ‘Aishah’s account as quoted in a modern sirah. The position of the house is illustrative."
msgstr "Kani waa wariyihii Caa'ishah sidii looga soo xigtay siirada casriga ah. Goobta gurigu ku yaal waa qiyaas."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "Stones in the niche"
msgstr "Dhagaxaan ku jira godka derbiga"

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "Abu Bakr took all his money with him, five or six thousand dirhams. Asma recounts that her blind grandfather feared the family had been left with nothing. She put stones where the money used to be kept, covered them with a cloth, and guided his hand to them so that he would be at ease."
msgstr "Abuu Bakar wuxuu qaatay lacagtiisii oo dhan, shan ama lix kun oo dirham. Asmaa waxay ka sheekaysay in awooweheedii indhoolaha ahaa uu ka cabsaday in qoyska laga tagay iyagoon waxba haysan. Waxay dhagaxaan dhigtay meeshii lacagta lagu kaydin jiray, waxayna ku dabooltay maro, waxayna ku hagtay gacantiisa si uu u dhowro oo uu u xasilo."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "Reported by Ibn Ishaq from Asma through her grandson. The position of the house is illustrative."
msgstr "Waxaa wariyey Ibn Isxaaq oo ka wariyey Asmaa iyadoo sii maraysa wiilka ay ayeeyada u tahay. Goobta gurigu ku yaal waa qiyaas."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "Why south?"
msgstr "Maxay tahay sababta koonfurta loo aaday?"

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "Madinah lies to the north, and that is where a search would begin. They left in the opposite direction, on the road towards Yemen, for about five miles to Mount Thawr."
msgstr "Madiina waxay dhanka waqooyi kaga beegan tahay Makkah, waana halka uu baadi-goobku ka bilaaban lahaa. Waxay u kicitimeen dhanka ka soo horjeeda, ee wadada aadda dhanka Yemen, qiyaastii shan mayl ilaa Buurta Thawr."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "This is a modern author’s reading of the route, not wording from an early report."
msgstr "Tani waa fahamka qoraa casri ah oo ku saabsan marinka, ee ma aha ereyo laga soo xigtay wariyihii hore."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "She of the two belts"
msgstr "Tiidii labada suun lahayd"

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "When the three nights had passed, Asma brought their provisions but had forgotten a strap to hang the bag. She undid her waist-belt and used it. For that she was called Dhat al-Nitaqayn, she of the two belts."
msgstr "Markay saddexdii habeen dhammaadeen, Asmaa waxay u keentay sahaydoodii laakiin waxay ilowday suunkii lagu xiri lahaa boorsada. Waxay furatay suunkeeda dhexda waxayna u adeegsatay inay ku xirto. Sidaas darteed waxaa loogu yeeray Dhat al-Nitaqayn, tii labada suun lahayd."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "Ibn Ishaq’s report. ‘Aishah’s account in al-Bukhari places the belt at the packing of the provisions instead."
msgstr "Wariyihii Ibn Isxaaq. Wariyaha Caa'ishah ee ku dhex jira al-Bukhari wuxuu dhigayaa in suunka la adeegsaday xilligii sahayda la diyaarinayay."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "The spider’s web"
msgstr "Haroobka caarada"

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "One report says the pursuers climbed the mountain, passed the cave, and saw a spider’s web across its opening. No one could have gone in, they reasoned, and they moved on. Ibn Kathir calls its chain good, the best of what is reported on this. The scene does not draw the web."
msgstr "Wariyo ka mid ah wariyadaha ayaa sheegaya in kuwii eryanayay ay fuuleen buurta, ay dhaafeen godka, oo ay ku arkeen haroob caaro oo ku fidsan afka godka. Waxay is yiraahdeen qofna ma geli kareen, markaasay iska dhaafeen. Ibn Kathir wuxuu silsiladda wariyayaasheeda ku tilmaamay mid wanaagsan, waana tan ugu wanaagsan ee laga wariyey arrintan. Muqaalku ma muujinayo haroobka."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "A single report. The nesting doves of popular retellings are not part of it."
msgstr "Waa wariyo keliya. Shimbiraha qoolleyda ah ee ku buul-gala sheekooyinka caanka ah qayb kama aha arrintan."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "The stations of the road"
msgstr "Saldhigyada wadada"

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "Ibn Ishaq names the way the guide took: below Makkah, along the coast, across the road below ‘Usfan, below Amaj, past Qudayd, then al-Kharrar, Thaniyyat al-Marah, Liqf and on. Many of these names are hard to place today, so the line drawn here stays approximate."
msgstr "Ibn Isxaaq wuxuu magacaabay wadadii uu haguhu qaaday: Makkah hoosteeda, xeebta hareeraheeda, wadada ka hoosaysa 'Usfan, hoos u sii dhaadhaca Amaj, ka dib Qudayd, ka dibna al-Kharrar, Thaniyyat al-Marah, Liqf iyo wixii la mid ah. Qaar badan oo ka mid ah magacyadan way adag tahay in maanta la garto meelaha ay ku yaallaan, sidaas darteed xariiqda halkan lagu sawiray waa mid qiyaas ah."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "A list of names, without distances or days."
msgstr "Waa liis magacyo ah, iyadoo aan la xusin masaafooyin ama maalmo."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "White garments"
msgstr "Dhar cadcad"

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "On the way they met al-Zubayr with a group of Muslim merchants returning from Syria. He gave the Prophet ﷺ and Abu Bakr white garments to wear."
msgstr "Intii ay jidka ku jireen waxay la kulmeen al-Zubayr oo la socda koox ganacsato Muslimiin ah oo ka soo laabtay dhanka Shaam. Wuxuu siiyay Nabiga ﷺ iyo Abuu Bakar dhar cadcad oo ay xidhaan."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "From al-Bukhari, as quoted by Ibn Kathir. The account does not say where on the road they met."
msgstr "Waxaa laga soo xigtay al-Bukhari, sidii uu u soo xigtay Ibn Kathir. Wariyuhu ma sheegin meesha ay jidka kaga kulmeen."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "The first Friday"
msgstr "Jimcihii ugu horreeyay"

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "After leaving Quba, the time for Friday prayer came while he was among Banu Salim ibn ‘Awf. He led it there, in the mosque in the bed of the valley, with about a hundred men."
msgstr "Ka dib markii uu ka tagay Quba, xilligii salaadda Jimcaha ayaa la gaaray isagoo jooga dhexda Banu Salim ibn 'Awf. Wuxuu ku hoggaamiyay salaadda halkaas, oo ahayd masaajidka ku yaal dooxada dhexdeeda, isagoo la tukanayay qiyaastii boqol nin."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "Quoted from a modern sirah, which cites Ibn Hisham. The position is illustrative."
msgstr "Waxaa laga soo xigtay siirada casriga ah, oo soo xiganaysa Ibn Hisham. Goobtu waa qiyaas."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "Let her go"
msgstr "Sii daaya iyada"

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "Clan after clan took hold of his camel’s rope and invited him to stay with them. Each time he answered: let her go, for she is under command. She walked on until she knelt in the quarter of Banu Malik ibn al-Najjar."
msgstr "Qabiilba qabiilka kale ka dib ayaa qabsanayay xadhigga rarkeeda iyagoo ku martiqaadayay inuu la dego. Mar kasta wuxuu ugu jawaabayay: sii daaya iyada, waayo waa mid la amray. Waxay u socotay ilaa ay ku fariisatay agagaarka Banu Malik ibn al-Najjar."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "Ibn Ishaq’s report. Her path through the town is not known."
msgstr "Wariyihii Ibn Isxaaq. Jidkii ay magaalada dhex martay lama yaqaan."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "The house of Abu Ayyub"
msgstr "Gurigii Abuu Ayuub"

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "He stayed in the house of Abu Ayyub until his mosque and his rooms were built, and he worked on the building himself alongside the Muhajirun and the Ansar."
msgstr "Wuxuu degay guriga Abuu Ayuub ilaa laga dhisay masaajidkiisa iyo qolalkiisa, wuxuuna isagu shakhsiyan uga qayb qaatay dhismaha isagoo garab taagan Muhaajiriinta iyo Ansaarta."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "The house is placed beside the mosque site for illustration."
msgstr "Guriga waxaa la dhigay masaajidka dhankiisa si loo muujiyo qiyaas ahaan."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "Brothers"
msgstr "Walaalo"

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "He paired those who had migrated with those who received them, as brothers, so that each newcomer had someone to lean on."
msgstr "Wuxuu walaaleeyay kuwii soo hijrooday iyo kuwii soo dhoweeyay, si uu qof kasta oo cusub u helo qof uu ku tiirsanaado."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "This is Ibn Kathir’s chapter heading. The individual pairings are listed in the pages that follow it."
msgstr "Kani waa cinwaanka cutubka Ibn Kathir. Walaalnimada gaarka ah waxaa lagu taxay boggaga ku xiga."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "The full moon has risen"
msgstr "Tala'al badru 'alaynaa"

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "A well-known report says the women and children sang “The full moon has risen upon us, from the passes of al-Wada‘” when he arrived. Al-Bayhaqi relates it from Ibn ‘Aishah, a later narrator, not from someone who was there."
msgstr "Warbixin caan ah ayaa sheegaysa in haweenka iyo carruurtu ay qaadeen heesta \"Tala'al badru 'alaynaa, min saniyaatil-wadaa'\" markii uu soo gaaray. Al-Bayhaqi wuxuu ka wariyey Ibn 'Aishah oo ah sheegay dambe, ee ma aha qof goobjoog ahaa."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "The chain stops short of an eyewitness, and some place the song at a later return to Madinah, not at this arrival."
msgstr "Silsiladda wariyayaasha ma gaarayso qof goobjoog ahaa, qaarna waxay heesta ku xiraan xilli dambe oo uu ku soo laabtay Madiina, ee ma aha imaatinkan."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "Along the way"
msgstr "Dabada jidka"

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "Close detail"
msgstr "Xidh faahfaahinta"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "Leaving Makkah"
msgstr "Ka bixitaanka Makkah"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "Night of 27 Safar · 12–13 September 622"
msgstr "Habeenka 27 Safar · 12–13 Sebteembar 622"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "The night of departure is in the accounts. Its place in the calendar is a modern reckoning."
msgstr "Habeenka bixitaanka wuxuu ku xusan yahay wariyadaha. Meesha uu kaga beegan yahay taariikhda miilaadiga ah waa xisaabin casri ah."

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "The nights before Friday, Saturday and Sunday"
msgstr "Habeennada ka horreeya Jimcaha, Sabtida iyo Axadda"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "Three nights is in al-Bukhari. Naming them after the days of the week follows a modern reckoning."
msgstr "Saddexda habeen waxay ku xusan yihiin al-Bukhari. Magacaabidda maalmaha toddobaadka waxay raacaysaa xisaabin casri ah."

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "The guide arrives"
msgstr "Hagaha oo yimid"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "Night of Monday, 1 Rabi‘ al-Awwal · 16 September 622"
msgstr "Habeenka Isniinta, 1 Rabi' al-Awwal · 16 Sebteembar 622"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "The guide came with the two mounts after the third night, as arranged. The calendar date is a modern reckoning."
msgstr "Hagaha wuxuu la yimid labadii rukuub dambe ka dib habeenkii saddexaad, sidii lagu heshiiyey. Taariikhda miilaadiga ah waa xisaabin casri ah."

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "On the coastal road"
msgstr "Waddada xeebta"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "About a week"
msgstr "Qiyaastii toddobaad"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "The accounts give the order of what happened on the road, but no days. The pursuit and the tent of Umm Ma‘bad fall somewhere in this week."
msgstr "Wariyaduhu waxay sheegayaan siday wax u dhaceen waddada, laakiin ma sheegayaan maalmaha. Eryashadii iyo teendhadii Umm Ma'bad waxay ku beegan yihiin meel ka mid ah toddobaadkan."

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "Arrival at Quba"
msgstr "Gaarista Quba"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "Monday · 8 Rabi‘ al-Awwal · 23 September 622"
msgstr "Isniin · 8 Rabi' al-Awwal · 23 Sebteembar 622"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "The account in al-Bukhari says it was a Monday in Rabi‘ al-Awwal. The day of the month is a modern reckoning."
msgstr "Warisada al-Bukhari waxay sheegaysaa inay ahayd maalin Isniin ah oo ku beegan Rabiic al-Awwal. Maalinta bisha waa xisaab dambe oo casri ah."

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "The stay at Quba"
msgstr "Joogitaankii Quba"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "Four days, or more than ten nights"
msgstr "Afar casho, ama in ka badan toban habeen"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "Ibn Ishaq gives Monday to Thursday. The report in al-Bukhari says more than ten nights, and Banu ‘Amr ibn ‘Awf said eighteen. Ibn Kathir sets the reports side by side without settling it."
msgstr "Ibn Isxaaq wuxuu sheegay Isniin ilaa Khamiis. Warisada al-Bukhari waxay sheegaysaa in ka badan toban habeen, Banu Camr ibn Cawf-na waxay yiraahdeen siddeed iyo toban. Ibn Kathiir wuxuu dhinac dhigay warbixinnada isagoon midna go'aamin."

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "The first Friday, and Madinah"
msgstr "Jimcihii ugu horreeyay, iyo Madiina"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "Friday · 12 Rabi‘ al-Awwal · 27 September 622"
msgstr "Jimco · 12 Rabiic al-Awwal · 27 Sebtembar 622"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "That it was a Friday is in the early reports. The calendar date is a modern reckoning, and it follows the four-day stay."
msgstr "Inay ahayd maalin Jimco ah waxay ku jirtaa warbixinnadii hore. Taariikhda kalandarka waa xisaab dambe oo casri ah, waxayna raacaysaa joogitaankii afarta casho ahaa."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "Evidence shown. Each point is a cited passage, coloured by kind."
msgstr "Caddaymaha waa la muujiyey. Qodob kastaa waa nuskho laga soo xigtay ilo, waxaana loo midabeeyey si waafaqsan noociisa."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "Evidence hidden."
msgstr "Caddaymaha waa la qariyey."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "Hide evidence on the map"
msgstr "Ku qari caddaymaha khariidadda"

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "Show evidence on the map"
msgstr "Ku muuji caddaymaha khariidadda"

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "Hide timeline"
msgstr "Qari khadka waqtiga"

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "Show timeline"
msgstr "Muuji khadka waqtiga"

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "How each date is known"
msgstr "Sida loo ogaaday taariikh kasta"

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "<0/>Stated in the account"
msgstr "<0/>Waxay ku xusan tahay wariyada"

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "<0/>Reckoned later"
msgstr "<0/>Waa la xisaabiyey dambe"

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "<0/>Accounts differ"
msgstr "<0/>Wariyadaha waa ay ku kala duwan yihiin"

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "<0/>Not dated"
msgstr "<0/>Ma taariikhaysna"

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "The journey day by day · September 622"
msgstr "Safarka maalinba maalin · Sebteembar 622"

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "Scrub through the days of the journey"
msgstr "U kala gudub maalmaha safarka"

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "Go to this stage <0/>"
msgstr "Aad marxaladdan <0/>"

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "The Quran"
msgstr "Qur'aanka"

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "Hadith collections"
msgstr "Kutubta Xadiiska"

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "Classical sirah and history"
msgstr "Siirooyinka qadiimiga ah iyo taariikhda"

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "Modern authors"
msgstr "Qorayaasha casriga ah"

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "Evidence on the map"
msgstr "Caddaymaha khariidadda ku yaal"

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "Each point of light is a passage this chapter cites, placed where it speaks of. Select one to read it."
msgstr "Dhibic kasta oo ifaysa waa nuskho laga soo xigtay cutubkan, waxaana la dhigay meesha ay ka hadlayso. Dooro mid si aad u akhrisato."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "This is the story of the Hijrah: when the Prophet Muhammad ﷺ travelled from Makkah to Madinah, a new home."
msgstr "Tani waa sheekadii Hijrada: markii uu Nabiga ﷺ ka safray Makkah isagoo u socda Madiina, oo ahayd guri cusub."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Many Muslims had already gone ahead. His best friend, Abu Bakr, waited so that they could travel together."
msgstr "Muslimiin badan ayaa horay u sii baxay. Saaxiibkiisii ugu dhawaa, ee Abu Bakar, ayaa sugay si ay u wada safraan."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "The Prophet ﷺ and Abu Bakr hid in a cave on Mount Thawr for three nights."
msgstr "Nabiga ﷺ iyo Abu Bakar waxay ku dhuunteen god ku yaalla Buurta Thawr muddo saddex habeen ah."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Each night, Abu Bakr’s son ‘Abdullah came in the dark to tell them the news from Makkah."
msgstr "Habeen kasta, wiilka Abu Bakar ee Cabdullaahi ayaa imaan jiray mugdiga si uu ugu sheego warka ka jira Makkah."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "A shepherd called ‘Amir brought his sheep close every evening, so that they had milk to drink."
msgstr "Adhi-jir la oran jiray Caamir ayaa soo dhoweyn jiray adhigiisa makhrib kasta, si ay u helaan caano ay cabbaan."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Abu Bakr was worried: if someone looked down, they would be seen! The Prophet ﷺ calmed him."
msgstr "Abu Bakar wuu walwalsanaa: haddii qof hoos u eego, waa la arki lahaa! Nabiga ﷺ ayaa dejiyay."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "The Quran remembers what the Prophet ﷺ said to his friend in the cave: do not be sad, Allah is with us."
msgstr "Qur'aanku wuxuu xusayaa wixii uu Nabiga ﷺ ku yiri saaxiibkiis markii ay ku jireen godka: ha murugoon, Alle wuxuu nala jiraa annaga."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Quraysh offered a big reward to catch them. A rider called Suraqah raced after them on his horse."
msgstr "Qureysh waxay ballanqaadday abaalmarin weyn si loo soo qabto. Nin faras fuushan oo la oran jiray Suraaqah ayaa ka daba orday isagoo faraskiisa ku jooga."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "As he came close, his horse’s legs sank into the ground, and he fell off!"
msgstr "Markii uu u soo dhowaaday, addimada faraskiisa ayaa dhulka ku dhex liqmeen, wuuna ka dhacay!"

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Suraqah gave up the chase. They asked him only to keep their secret, and went on their way."
msgstr "Suraaqah wuu iska daayay eryashadii. Waxay ka codsadeen oo keliya inuu qariyo sirtooda, markaasay jidkoodii iska sii wateen."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "At last they reached Madinah! The Prophet’s camel walked through the town and knelt in an open yard."
msgstr "Ugu dambayntii waxay gaareen Madiina! Haladii Nabiga waxay dhex martay magaalada waxayna ku fariisatay barxad bannaan."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "That yard became the place of his mosque, and he carried bricks to help build it."
msgstr "Barxaddaas waxay noqotay goobtii masjidkiisa, wuxuuna xambaaray leben si uu gacan uga geysto dhismihiisa."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "One hot noon, the Prophet ﷺ came to Abu Bakr’s house with big news: it was time to go. Abu Bakr asked to come too, and he said yes."
msgstr "Maalin duhur kulul ah, Nabiga ﷺ ayaa yimid guriga Abu Bakar isagoo wada war weyn: waxay ahayd xilligii la bixi lahaa. Abu Bakar wuxuu weydiistay inuu raaco, isna wuu ka aqbalay."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Abu Bakr took all his money for the journey. His daughter Asma put stones in its place to comfort her grandfather, who could not see."
msgstr "Abuu Bakr wuxuu safarka u qaatay dhammaan lacagtiisii. Gabadhiisa Asma ayaa dhagaxaan ku beddeshay si ay u dhiirigeliso awowgeed oo aan waxba arki karin."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Asma used her belt to tie up their food bag. People called her “the one with two belts”."
msgstr "Asma waxay suunkeeda u adeegsatay inay ku xirto kiishka cuntada. Dadku waxay u bixiyeen “tii labada suun lahayd”."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "One report says the searchers saw a spider’s web across the cave and walked away."
msgstr "Warbixin baa sheegaysa in dadkii raadinayay ay arkeen shabakad caaro-caaro oo ku fidsan godka dhexdiisa, markaasna ay iska tageen."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Their guide knew the desert well. He led them along the coast, past many places whose names we still know."
msgstr "Hagehoodu si fiican buu u yaqaanay saxaraha. Wuxuu ku hoggaamiyay dhanka xeebta, isagoo soo maray meelo badan oo aan weli magacyadooda naqaan."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "On the way, a friend called al-Zubayr gave them new white clothes."
msgstr "Jidka dhexdiisa, saaxiib la oran jiray al-Zubayr ayaa siiyay dhar cadcad oo cusub."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "On his way into Madinah, the Prophet ﷺ led Friday prayer with about a hundred people."
msgstr "Isagoo ku sii jeeda Madiina, Nabigu ﷺ wuxuu dad gaaraya boqol qof ku hoggaamiyay salaaddii Jimcaha."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Everyone wanted the Prophet ﷺ to stay with them. He said: let the camel go, she has been told where to stop."
msgstr "Qof kasta wuxuu rabay in Nabigu ﷺ uu la dego. Wuxuu yiri: daaya rida (awrka), waayo waxaa loo sheegay meesha ay istaagi lahayd."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "He stayed in the house of Abu Ayyub until his mosque and his home were built."
msgstr "Wuxuu degay guriga Abuu Ayuub ilaa laga dhisay masaajidkiisa iyo gurigiisa."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "He made the people who arrived and the people of Madinah brothers, to help each other."
msgstr "Wuxuu walaaleeyay dadkii soo guuray iyo dadkii Madiina, si ay isu caawiyaan."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Many people remember a happy song sung to welcome him, but we are not sure it was sung that day."
msgstr "Dad badan ayaa xusuusta hees farxad leh oo lagu soo dhoweeyay, laakiin ma hubno in la qaaday maalintaas."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "The Hijrah is so central that the Islamic calendar counts its years from it."
msgstr "Hicradu aad bay muhiim u tahay, taas oo keentay in kalandarka Islaamku uu ka bilaabo xisaabinta sannadihiisa."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Trust and careful planning sit side by side: the Prophet ﷺ relied on Allah and still prepared every step."
msgstr "Kala-doorashada iyo qorshaynta taxaddarka leh way weheliyaan: Nabigu ﷺ wuxuu talosaartay Alle, haddana wuxuu diyaariyay tillaabo kasta."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Even with people plotting against him, he made sure their property was returned. His honesty did not depend on how he was treated."
msgstr "Xitaa iyadoo dadku ay maleegayeen shirqool ka dhan ah, wuxuu hubiyay in hantidoodii loo celiyo. Daacadnimadiisu kuma xirnayn sida loola dhaqmo."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "In the most frightening moment, the lesson is calm trust: Allah is with us."
msgstr "Xilliga ugu cabsida badan, casharku waa kalsooni deggenaan leh: Alle waa nala jiraa."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Choosing an unexpected route was wisdom, not doubt. Muslims are taught to trust Allah and still take sensible steps."
msgstr "Doorashada waddo aan la filayn waxay ahayd xikmad, ee ma ahayn shaki. Muslimiinta waxaa la baraa inay talosaartaan Alle, haddana qaadaan tillaabooyin caqli-gal ah."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "A man who set out to capture them left asking for their protection. The story is full of reversals like this."
msgstr "Nin u soo baxay inuu soo qabto ayaa ka tagay isagoo weydiisanaya badbaado. Sheekadu waxay ku dhowdahay isbeddello sidan oo kale ah."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Hospitality from strangers, and blessing in very little, run through the whole of the Prophet’s life."
msgstr "Martisooridda dadka qariibka ah, iyo barakada waxa aadka u yar, waxay dhex maraan nolosha Nabiga oo dhan."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Short for “peace and blessings of Allah be upon him”, said by Muslims after the Prophet’s name."
msgstr "Waa soo gaabin laga soo qaatay \"Naxariis iyo nabadgelyo Alle ha u fidinno dushiisa\", oo ay Muslimiintu yiraahdaan marka la sheego magaca Nabiga."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Hijrah"
msgstr "Hicrada"

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "The migration of the Prophet ﷺ and his companions from Makkah to Madinah, in 622."
msgstr "Guuritaankii Nabiga ﷺ iyo asxaabtiisa ay uga soo guureen Makkah ilaa Madiina, sannadkii 622."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Quraysh"
msgstr "Qureysh"

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "The leading tribe of Makkah. The Prophet ﷺ himself belonged to it."
msgstr "Qabiilkii ugu weynaa ee Makkah. Nabiga ﷺ laftiisa ayaa ka tirsanaa."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "The city where the Prophet ﷺ was born, home of the Ka‘bah."
msgstr "Magaaladii uu ku dhashay Nabiga ﷺ, oo ah guriga Kacbada."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Then called Yathrib: the city that welcomed the Prophet ﷺ. Its name means “the city”."
msgstr "Waxa markaas loo oran jiray Yathrib: magaaladii soo dhoweysay Nabiga ﷺ. Magaceedu wuxuu ka dhigan yahay \"magaalada\"."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Abu Bakr"
msgstr "Abuu Bakr"

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "The Prophet’s closest friend and companion, who later led the Muslims after him."
msgstr "Nabiga saaxiibkiisii ugu dhowaa, kaas oo markii dambe hoggaamiyay Muslimiinta isaga ka dib."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Allah"
msgstr "Alle"

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "The Arabic word for God."
msgstr "Ereyga Carabiga ah ee loo isticmaalo Ilaah."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "The holy book of Islam, which Muslims believe is the word of Allah."
msgstr "Kitaabka barakaysan ee Islaamka, kaas oo Muslimiintu ay aaminsan yihiin inuu yahay hadalka Alle."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "The collection of hadith that Muslims consider the most reliable."
msgstr "Ururinta axadiista ee ay Muslimiintu u arkaan inay tahay tan ugu kalsoonida badan."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Ibn Kathir"
msgstr "Ibn Kathir"

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "A scholar of the fourteenth century whose history of the Prophet’s life is widely used."
msgstr "Aqoonyahan noolaa qarnigii afar iyo tobnaad, kaas oo taariikhda uu ka qoray nolosha Nabiga si weyn loo isticmaalo."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Ibn Ishaq"
msgstr "Ibn Isxaaq"

#: src/content/lenses.js
#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Thawr"
msgstr "Thawr"

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "A mountain south of Makkah, with a small cave near its top."
msgstr "Buur ku taal koonfurta Maka, oo god yar uu ku yaal meel u dhow dhaladeeda."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "A village on the edge of Madinah, where the Prophet ﷺ stopped first."
msgstr "Tuulo ku taal darafka Madiina, halkaas oo uu Nebigu ﷺ marka hore istaagay."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "A passage of the Quran, the holy book of Islam."
msgstr "Aayad ka mid ah Qur'aanka, kitaabka barakaysan ee Islaamka."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "A hadith: a report of the Prophet’s words or deeds, passed on through named narrators. The collections of al-Bukhari and Muslim are considered the most reliable."
msgstr "Xadiis: warbixin ku saabsan ereyadii ama ficiladii Nebiga, oo loo soo gudbiyay si silsilad ah iyadoo la magacaabay weriyeyaasha. Ururinta al-Bukhari iyo Muslim ayaa loo tixgeliyaa kuwa ugu kalsoonida badan."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "A report from the early histories of the Prophet’s life. They gather many accounts, some stronger than others."
msgstr "Warbixin ka timid taariikhihii hore ee nolosha Nebiga. Waxay kulmiyaan werisyo badan, kuwaas oo qaarkood ay ka xoog badan yihiin kuwa kale."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "A modern author’s explanation or calculation, built on the early sources."
msgstr "Sharaxaad ama xisaabin uu sameeyay qoraa casri ah, oo ku dhisana ilaha hore."

