msgstr "Lix marxaladood oo gaagaaban, oo lagu qoray ereyo fudud."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "Terms explained, and why each stage matters."
msgstr "Ereyada oo la sharraxay, iyo sababta ay marxalad kasta muhiim u tahay."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "Every detail, with the evidence and the timeline open."
msgstr "Faahfaahin kasta, iyadoo caddaymaha iyo khadka wakhtiga ay furan yihiin."

