#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "Why this matters:"
msgstr "Sababta ay tani muhiim u tahay:"

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "Terms"
msgstr "Ereyada"

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "Abu Bakr prepared two camels. Asma helped pack food for the journey."
msgstr "Abu Bakr wuxuu diyaariyey laba halaad. Asma waxay ka caawisay sahayda safarka."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "They chose a guide who knew the roads well. He would bring their camels after three nights."
msgstr "Waxay doorteen hage waddooyinka si fiican u yaqaannay. Wuxuu geelooda u keeni doonaa saddex habeen kaddib."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "An early account tells how the leaders of Quraysh met in Makkah to plan against the Prophet ﷺ."
msgstr "Warbixin hore waxay sheegaysaa sida madaxdii Quraysh ay Makka ugu shireen si ay shirqool ugu maleegaan Nabiga ﷺ."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "The account says they waited outside his door that night, while ‘Ali slept in his bed, wrapped in his green cloak."
msgstr "Warbixintu waxay leedahay waxay habeenkaas taagnaayeen bannaanka albaabkiisa, halka Cali uu ku seexday sariirtiisa isagoo ku duuban go'iisii cagaarnaa."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "After three nights, their guide brought the camels. They left the cave and travelled towards Madinah."
msgstr "Saddex habeen kaddib, hagahoodii ayaa geelii keenay. Waxay ka baxeen godkii waxayna u kicitimeen xagga Madiina."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "They took a route near the coast. The journey was long, with many stops along the way."
msgstr "Waxay qaadeen waddo dhinaca xeebta ah. Safarku wuu dheeraa, iyagoo meelo badan jidka ku nastay."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "Another account describes a stop at Umm Ma‘bad’s tent. She had a thin sheep that was not giving milk."
msgstr "Warbixin kale waxay sharraxaysaa joogsi ay ku nasteen teendhada Umm Macbad. Waxay haysatay neef idaad ah oo dhuuban oo aan caano lahayn."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "It says the Prophet ﷺ prayed and milked the sheep, and there was milk for everyone."
msgstr "Waxay leedahay Nabigu ﷺ wuu duceeyey wuuna lisay idadii, qof walbana wuxuu helay caano ku filan."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "They first stopped at Quba, near Madinah, where a mosque was founded."
msgstr "Markii hore waxay ku nasteen Quba, oo u dhow Madiina, halkaas oo masaajid laga aasaasay."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "Madinah is to the north. They went south first, towards Mount Thawr."
msgstr "Madiina waxay xigtaa woqooyiga. Waxay marka hore aadeen koonfurta, dhinaca Buur Thawr."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "A mosque was founded at Quba, making worship a part of life in the new home."
msgstr "Masaajid ayaa laga aasaasay Quba, taasoo cibaadada ka dhigtay qayb ka mid ah nolosha hoyga cusub."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "Madinah became a home for the growing Muslim community, bringing newcomers and their hosts together."
msgstr "Madiina waxay hoy u noqotay bulshadii muslimiinta ee sii kordhaysay, iyadoo kulmisay dadkii cusbaa iyo kuwii soo dhoweeyey."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "An eighth-century historian whose accounts of the Prophet’s life are preserved by later writers."
msgstr "Taariikhyahan qarnigii sideedaad noolaa oo xogtiisii ku saabsanayd nolosha Nabiga ay xafideen qoraayaal dambe."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
msgid "Mode changed. Your place is saved."
msgstr "Habka waa la beddelay. Meeshaadii waa la kaydiyey."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "‘Ali stayed behind to return the precious things that people had left with the Prophet ﷺ."
msgstr "‘Cali wuxuu dib u haray si uu u soo celiyo alaabtii qaaliga ahayd ee ay dadku kaga tageen Nabiga ﷺ."

#: src/lib/scene-manifest.js
msgid "E09"
msgstr "E09"

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "In Madinah, Muslims went out to wait for the Prophet ﷺ. The arrival account tells how they welcomed him."
msgstr "Madiina gudaheeda, Muslimiintu waxay u baxeen inay sugaan Nabiga ﷺ. Werinta imaatinka waxay sheegaysaa sida ay u soo dhoweeyeen."

